# JakshWealth UI

Angular **21** personal stock-analysis app. Read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root first.

## Constraints

- **Do not** scaffold a new app shell — `AppHeaderBar` already exists.
- **Do not** invent auth flows — use `AuthService`, `UserService`, `AuthorizationService`, `authGuard`.

## Patterns to copy

- New feature → `features/stock-analysis/`
- Lazy routing → `app.routes.ts` + `layout/feature-layout.ts`
- Protected route → `canActivate: [authGuard]`
- Page layout → `components/about/`, `features/stock-analysis/stock-analysis-home.html`

## Skills

- New feature page → **`jw-feature-page`** (`.cursor/skills/jw-feature-page/SKILL.md`)
